WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.793
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:05.839
We were interviewed on film for a
school club promotional video.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.340
It's way foo honest!

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.842
Invasion of privacy!

00:00:09.217 --> 00:00:11.636
A new issue was brought to our attention.

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:13.471
Who's fit to lead, huh?

00:00:13.471 --> 00:00:16.558
In our PV, the center spot
is reserved for the leader.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:20.437
Even after a bunch of different competitions,
we couldn't settle on a leader.

00:00:20.437 --> 00:00:22.856
Maybe we don't need a dedicated leader.

00:00:23.148 --> 00:00:25.066
Believe it or not, we did
elect our group leader.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.484
C'mon, let's get started!

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:29.946
Finally, there was some kind of emergency!

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.406
It's an emergency!

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:32.198
Huh?

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.825
Love Live!

00:00:33.825 --> 00:00:37.078
The Love Live event will be held soon!

00:00:37.078 --> 00:00:38.330
Love Live, huh!?

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.999
So, what's that?

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:57.849
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:00:57.849 --> 00:01:02.687
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:01:02.687 --> 00:01:07.484
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:01:07.484 --> 00:01:12.072
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.156
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:17.035
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:01:17.035 --> 00:01:18.036
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:21.831
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:22.916
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:01:22.916 --> 00:01:27.003
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:31.633
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:36.638
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:01:36.638 --> 00:01:41.309
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:46.481
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:01:46.481 --> 00:01:51.444
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:01:51.444 --> 00:01:56.950
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:01:56.950 --> 00:02:04.541
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:02:05.917 --> 00:02:09.295
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:02:11.756 --> 00:02:15.051
#7 - Elichika Love Live is like, the
event to end all events for school idols!

00:02:15.051 --> 00:02:20.724
The top 20 school idol groups
who enter will perform.

00:02:20.890 --> 00:02:22.976
The event determines who's the top group.

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:27.147
I had heard rumors that one might be
coming up, but to see it confirmed...

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.189
I see.

00:02:28.189 --> 00:02:31.776
School idols are popular
throughout the country.

00:02:31.776 --> 00:02:34.237
There's no way people wouldn't get excited!

00:02:34.237 --> 00:02:37.741
Of the current top 20 school idol groups,

00:02:37.741 --> 00:02:42.287
A-RISE will obviously perform due to
being in first place, but second and third...

00:02:42.287 --> 00:02:44.873
Th-This is like a dream come true...

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:47.375
I wonder when tickets will go on sale.

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:49.085
What kind of first-day swag will they have?

00:02:49.377 --> 00:02:51.629
Hanayo-chan, you're gonna go to it?

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:54.090
Of course!

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:56.843
It's the greatest event in the history of idols!

00:02:56.843 --> 00:02:58.219
I'd rather die than miss it.

00:02:58.553 --> 00:03:01.347
When it comes to idols, she acts
like a completely different person.

00:03:01.347 --> 00:03:03.516
I like this personality of hers, too.

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:08.813
Oh, okay! I totally thought you were gonna
say we should perform there, too.

00:03:10.440 --> 00:03:14.861
Th-Th-This is something
way out of our league!

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.488
Too much of a departure.

00:03:16.488 --> 00:03:18.907
I liked that uncharacteristic outburst, too!

00:03:18.907 --> 00:03:21.451
Well... we are school idols.

00:03:21.451 --> 00:03:23.661
It can't hurt to try.

00:03:23.661 --> 00:03:25.580
You mean, "We gotta try!"

00:03:25.955 --> 00:03:28.708
Life won't give you handouts just like that.

00:03:29.042 --> 00:03:30.168
True enough.

00:03:30.668 --> 00:03:37.008
Based on last week's rankings, we're
nowhere near high enough to perform...

00:03:38.802 --> 00:03:40.011
Honoka! Kotori!

00:03:41.429 --> 00:03:42.472
That's awesome!

00:03:42.472 --> 00:03:43.932
Our rank went up again!

00:03:43.932 --> 00:03:45.058
No way!

00:03:45.058 --> 00:03:46.226
Oh, let me see.

00:03:48.019 --> 00:03:51.606
Our songs are getting listed
in the "featured videos" section.

00:03:51.773 --> 00:03:54.275
You're right. Look at those comments.

00:03:54.275 --> 00:03:56.361
"Your newest song is awesome."

00:03:56.361 --> 00:03:57.904
"You have seven members now!"

00:03:57.904 --> 00:04:00.657
"I love that I can feel your
hard work in your music."

00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:04.828
So do we have tons of fans now!?

00:04:04.828 --> 00:04:06.120
That explains it...

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:06.621
What?

00:04:06.621 --> 00:04:07.789
The other day...

00:04:08.998 --> 00:04:11.668
Um, can we take a picture with you?

00:04:11.668 --> 00:04:14.671
What? Uh, no.

00:04:14.671 --> 00:04:15.547
Huh?

00:04:22.345 --> 00:04:23.513
A waiting fan!?

00:04:23.513 --> 00:04:26.057
No way! Nothing like that
has happened to me!

00:04:26.057 --> 00:04:27.308
It's inevitable.

00:04:27.308 --> 00:04:30.854
Idols live in a harsh world,
almost like a caste system!

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:36.025
But you've really opened up if you're
willing to pose for pictures with strangers!

00:04:36.025 --> 00:04:38.069
I-1 wasn't willing or anything...

00:04:38.778 --> 00:04:40.321
Look at those cheeks glow!

00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:44.450
That hurt!

00:04:45.159 --> 00:04:47.078
You were asking for it.

00:04:49.372 --> 00:04:50.874
Hey! Listen to this!

00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:52.500
I caught wind of some big news!

00:04:53.126 --> 00:04:54.419
Nico-senpai.

00:04:55.545 --> 00:04:57.547
Try not to faint from surprise.

00:04:57.547 --> 00:05:01.259
This summer, it's finally happening.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:03.636
The school idol festival...!

00:05:03.636 --> 00:05:05.513
You mean Love Live, right?

00:05:06.890 --> 00:05:07.891
You knew already?

00:05:11.477 --> 00:05:14.522
No matter what, though, we know how
the student council will respond.

00:05:14.522 --> 00:05:17.483
Thou shalt not receive thy school's
blessing in this matter.

00:05:18.359 --> 00:05:19.944
I know, right?

00:05:19.944 --> 00:05:24.782
Still... 1 bet this would draw more
of a crowd than our last one.

00:05:24.782 --> 00:05:27.952
Doesn't matter to that foolish
student council president!

00:05:28.244 --> 00:05:30.622
She hates our guts.

00:05:30.622 --> 00:05:33.041
But why?

00:05:33.041 --> 00:05:34.292
Because, uh...

00:05:35.126 --> 00:05:38.963
Maybe she's scared that I'll
become more popular than her!

00:05:38.963 --> 00:05:40.089
Absolutely not the reason.

00:05:40.089 --> 00:05:41.466
Shut down instantly!?

00:05:43.009 --> 00:05:47.263
Why can't we just enter without
getting her approval?

00:05:47.263 --> 00:05:48.473
There's no way.

00:05:48.473 --> 00:05:52.936
Getting the school's permission is
a requisite for entering, after all.

00:05:52.936 --> 00:05:55.813
Then...let's ask the director
for permission directly.

00:05:55.813 --> 00:05:58.191
Wait, we can do that?

00:05:58.191 --> 00:06:03.279
Generally speaking, clubs are expected to
make requests through the student council...

00:06:03.279 --> 00:06:07.367
But it's not as though going directly
to the director is forbidden.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.286
See? It'll work out, somehow.

00:06:10.286 --> 00:06:12.455
After all, we have an ace up our sleeve.

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:21.422
I just got way more nervous...

00:06:21.422 --> 00:06:23.341
This is no time to back down.

00:06:23.341 --> 00:06:25.009
I kKnow.

00:06:28.638 --> 00:06:30.223
What're you all doing here?

00:06:31.557 --> 00:06:32.642
The student council president!

00:06:32.642 --> 00:06:34.268
Worst timing ever.

00:06:34.936 --> 00:06:36.270
What's this about?

00:06:37.772 --> 00:06:40.191
We're here to speak with the director.

00:06:41.859 --> 00:06:46.155
Club requests must go through the student
council when asking to meet with the director.

00:06:46.155 --> 00:06:48.241
Did I say we were making a request?

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.909
All I said was we're here to speak with her.

00:06:49.909 --> 00:06:52.662
Maki-chan, she's our senior...

00:06:58.376 --> 00:06:59.544
What's all this?

00:07:03.464 --> 00:07:04.173
I see.

00:07:04.549 --> 00:07:06.426
Love Live, was it?

00:07:07.218 --> 00:07:11.305
Yes. It'll be broadcast on the
Internet for everyone to see.

00:07:11.305 --> 00:07:16.227
We believe girls will want to learn more
about our school if we perform there.

00:07:16.227 --> 00:07:17.562
I'm opposed to this.

00:07:18.938 --> 00:07:24.819
It was made quite clear that we must not
sacrifice our school life for the school's sake.

00:07:24.819 --> 00:07:25.778
In other words...

00:07:26.279 --> 00:07:27.572
You aren't wrong.

00:07:27.572 --> 00:07:30.408
But why shouldn't we let them enter?

00:07:30.825 --> 00:07:32.285
For real?

00:07:32.285 --> 00:07:33.036
Yes.

00:07:33.036 --> 00:07:34.829
J-Just a moment.

00:07:34.829 --> 00:07:36.956
Why are you siding with them?

00:07:37.999 --> 00:07:40.168
This isn't about "taking sides."

00:07:40.168 --> 00:07:44.505
Then please, allow the student council
to try and revitalize the school!

00:07:45.882 --> 00:07:47.133
I can't allow that.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.010
I'm afraid I don't follow you.

00:07:49.010 --> 00:07:51.471
Really? It's common sense to me.

00:07:54.557 --> 00:07:55.433
Eli-chi.

00:08:01.856 --> 00:08:03.357
Serves you right.

00:08:03.357 --> 00:08:05.568
I do have one condition for your entry.

00:08:06.319 --> 00:08:08.571
Do not neglect your studies.

00:08:09.322 --> 00:08:13.367
If any one of you fail your final exams,

00:08:13.367 --> 00:08:15.578
you will be forbidden from entering Love Live.

00:08:15.953 --> 00:08:16.996
Is that clear?

00:08:19.082 --> 00:08:24.587
W-Well... Um, I don't think any of
us are going to fail exams...

00:08:26.339 --> 00:08:27.381
Um...?

00:08:28.466 --> 00:08:30.301
My sincerest apologies.

00:08:30.301 --> 00:08:31.177
Sorry...

00:08:31.177 --> 00:08:35.306
I've known Honoka since elementary
school, but honestly now...

00:08:35.306 --> 00:08:36.891
Just math, I promise!

00:08:36.891 --> 00:08:39.811
C'mon, you knew I was bad at
math even way back then.

00:08:39.977 --> 00:08:40.812
Seven times four.

00:08:41.229 --> 00:08:42.980
Twenty...six?

00:08:44.941 --> 00:08:46.734
Things just became dire.

00:08:47.276 --> 00:08:48.277
And you, Rin-chan?

00:08:48.277 --> 00:08:52.448
English! Me and English just don't agree!

00:08:52.448 --> 00:08:54.700
Y-Yeah, it's a tough subject...

00:08:55.201 --> 00:08:56.369
Right!?

00:08:56.369 --> 00:09:01.290
We're Japanese! Who needs to learn
a foreign language, anyway!?

00:09:01.874 --> 00:09:03.501
Stop whining!

00:09:03.501 --> 00:09:05.962
You can be really frightening, you know that?

00:09:05.962 --> 00:09:10.091
It would be beyond embarrassing if we
couldn't enter due to your shortcomings.

00:09:10.341 --> 00:09:12.009
You're right.

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:15.763
And after finally getting one over on
that student council president, too...

00:09:15.763 --> 00:09:17.849
E-Exactly.

00:09:19.016 --> 00:09:22.019
W-We can't possibly fail our tests.

00:09:22.937 --> 00:09:26.023
Nico-senpai, how are your grades?

00:09:26.023 --> 00:09:27.900
Ni-Ni-Ni-Nico?

00:09:28.442 --> 00:09:33.239
Ni-Ni-Nico-Nico-Ni couldn't possibly
ever fail her exams...!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:35.908
Far too transparent.

00:09:36.659 --> 00:09:42.790
Anyway, Kotori and I will help Honoka while
Hanayo and Maki tutor Rin until our exams.

00:09:42.790 --> 00:09:46.043
We shall do our utmost to improve their
scores in their weakest subjects.

00:09:46.627 --> 00:09:49.172
Yeah, that sounds fine, but...

00:09:49.172 --> 00:09:50.423
What about Nico-senpai?

00:09:50.882 --> 00:09:53.342
What? I'm pretty sure I already said...

00:09:53.718 --> 00:09:56.179
Leave her education to me.

00:09:56.679 --> 00:09:57.638
Nozomi?

00:09:58.347 --> 00:09:59.891
Are you sure?

00:09:59.891 --> 00:10:03.060
Like I said. Don't worry about
cute little Nico failing any—

00:10:04.562 --> 00:10:07.440
If you lie, I'll give 'em a nice squeeze.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.859
Fine. Please teach me.

00:10:09.859 --> 00:10:11.277
Attagirl!

00:10:11.277 --> 00:10:13.738
Great, then it's a plan!

00:10:13.738 --> 00:10:15.781
- Let's start tomorrow!
- Yeah!

00:10:15.781 --> 00:10:17.158
We start now.

00:10:30.421 --> 00:10:31.464
Hello?

00:10:33.174 --> 00:10:36.135
Is this how it's gonna be every day...?

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.262
Of course it is.

00:10:38.930 --> 00:10:41.015
Whoa, look out! Wild white rice!

00:10:43.601 --> 00:10:45.895
Who would fall for that?

00:10:45.895 --> 00:10:47.188
- Yeah...
- I don't see it...

00:10:47.188 --> 00:10:48.022
College Entrance Exam Prep
Algebra I

00:10:48.773 --> 00:10:49.941
Kotori-chan.

00:10:49.941 --> 00:10:52.276
Yes? Just one more. C'mon, you can—

00:10:52.276 --> 00:10:53.444
Nap time.

00:10:53.444 --> 00:10:54.278
Honoka-chan?

00:10:54.278 --> 00:10:56.739
No, Honoka-chan!

00:10:56.739 --> 00:10:57.740
Unbelievable.

00:10:58.282 --> 00:11:00.159
Kotori, please take over from here.

00:11:00.701 --> 00:11:03.955
I have to get going to archery practice.

00:11:03.955 --> 00:11:05.039
"Kay.

00:11:05.039 --> 00:11:06.540
Hey you, wake up!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:09.043
Y-Yeah, okay, I get it. I do.

00:11:10.086 --> 00:11:13.172
Algebra Il Okay then, how would
you answer the next question?

00:11:13.172 --> 00:11:15.049
That's...uh...

00:11:15.049 --> 00:11:17.843
Ni...Nico-Nico-Ni...?

00:11:18.928 --> 00:11:21.138
Please, stop... No more...

00:11:21.514 --> 00:11:24.433
- Anything but my boobs!
- Honoka-chan, you gotta rise and shine!

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:27.270
If you don't get serious,
I might pop 'em next time!

00:11:27.436 --> 00:11:30.273
Okay, okay! I get it!

00:11:30.273 --> 00:11:33.234
- Will this really help them?
- You sure about that?

00:11:37.697 --> 00:11:38.906
See you later.

00:11:38.906 --> 00:11:40.283
Take care.

00:11:43.661 --> 00:11:44.578
That song...

00:12:04.265 --> 00:12:06.892
We never uploaded that
footage to our website...

00:12:09.061 --> 00:12:09.770
Sorry!

00:12:11.439 --> 00:12:13.983
You're Sonoda Umi-san, right? From p's?

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:18.738
Um, no. I believe you are mistaken.

00:12:21.907 --> 00:12:24.035
Er... No, you're right.

00:12:24.035 --> 00:12:25.536
I knew it!

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.081
A-Anyway, the video you were watching...

00:12:29.081 --> 00:12:31.334
It's from your concert!

00:12:31.334 --> 00:12:35.254
I couldn't make it, so my
sister filmed it for me.

00:12:35.588 --> 00:12:36.547
Your sister?

00:12:36.714 --> 00:12:37.590
Yes.

00:12:38.382 --> 00:12:39.425
Alisa.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:42.553
Hey, sis!

00:12:47.391 --> 00:12:48.434
You...

00:12:49.769 --> 00:12:51.437
The student council president...

00:12:57.276 --> 00:12:58.819
Love Live!

00:13:04.075 --> 00:13:05.576
Sorry for the wait.

00:13:06.243 --> 00:13:07.286
Thank you.

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:10.289
Oden?

00:13:11.165 --> 00:13:12.666
Sorry about her.

00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:17.421
We've lived most of our lives outside Japan,
so there are things she's still not aware of.

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:18.339
Outside Japan?

00:13:18.339 --> 00:13:20.549
Right. My grandmother is Russian.

00:13:21.258 --> 00:13:23.386
Alisa, what you bought isn't a beverage.

00:13:23.844 --> 00:13:26.263
Really? Ugh, khorosho.

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.474
Can you go find something else for her?

00:13:28.474 --> 00:13:29.308
Okay.

00:13:31.394 --> 00:13:34.897
I never planned for you to find out.

00:13:35.439 --> 00:13:38.442
The question came up when I spoke
with Honoka and the others.

00:13:38.442 --> 00:13:41.612
We had no idea who filmed and
uploaded our concert onto the Internet.

00:13:42.279 --> 00:13:44.865
Honestly...I'd never have guessed it was you.

00:13:46.158 --> 00:13:51.539
If not for that video's existence, I feel
as though...we would have given up.

00:13:51.539 --> 00:13:55.626
But because of it, more people have
been exposed to our music. So...

00:13:55.626 --> 00:13:56.502
Enough.

00:13:57.628 --> 00:14:00.881
I didn't do it to help you.

00:14:01.298 --> 00:14:02.842
Just the opposite, in fact.

00:14:02.842 --> 00:14:07.012
I wanted to show you how
low your abilities truly are.

00:14:07.638 --> 00:14:11.183
I wanted you to see that there was
no hope in continuing your efforts.

00:14:12.601 --> 00:14:16.230
Imagine my surprise when this
is what actually happened.

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:18.816
Rather than disband, you gained
several new members.

00:14:19.483 --> 00:14:21.610
It's...simply unacceptable.

00:14:22.987 --> 00:14:25.698
You're nowhere near ready to perform.

00:14:26.073 --> 00:14:30.077
I'd prefer you not use our school's
name in your current condition.

00:14:31.662 --> 00:14:32.788
That's all I have to say.

00:14:34.331 --> 00:14:35.458
Wait.

00:14:36.625 --> 00:14:39.253
If we succeed...

00:14:40.212 --> 00:14:44.967
If we become good enough to get people to
enroll at our school, then will you accept us?

00:14:48.262 --> 00:14:49.513
That's not possible.

00:14:49.513 --> 00:14:50.639
Why?

00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:56.270
Because, in my eyes, all school idols are
nothing but amateurs acting big.

00:14:56.270 --> 00:15:01.358
Even the best group, A-RISE,
look like kids playing pretend.

00:15:04.695 --> 00:15:05.821
But...

00:15:07.656 --> 00:15:08.949
Sorry, sis.

00:15:09.366 --> 00:15:11.702
We're done talking. It's quite all right.

00:15:14.413 --> 00:15:15.456
You...

00:15:16.582 --> 00:15:20.419
You've no right to talk down to us like that!

00:15:26.050 --> 00:15:27.426
Want a drink?

00:15:29.929 --> 00:15:30.888
Red Bean Soup

00:15:33.807 --> 00:15:35.893
Um, [___

00:15:35.893 --> 00:15:39.980
I really love J's and all its members.

00:15:48.697 --> 00:15:49.907
I said it...

00:15:49.907 --> 00:15:50.574
Huh?

00:15:50.574 --> 00:15:54.203
When I get into Otonokizaka High next year...

00:15:56.080 --> 00:15:57.957
Um... Nothing.

00:16:00.751 --> 00:16:01.961
Khorosho.

00:16:02.795 --> 00:16:03.337
What?

00:16:03.629 --> 00:16:05.798
So oden isn't a drink...?

00:16:05.798 --> 00:16:08.008
No. That's a food.

00:16:08.008 --> 00:16:09.802
Even though they have a curry drink?

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:11.637
Again, not a drink.

00:16:11.637 --> 00:16:13.639
But they said it was on TV.

00:16:13.639 --> 00:16:14.682
Did they?

00:16:15.307 --> 00:16:17.017
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:16:17.017 --> 00:16:21.146
Didn't I warn you that if you don't get
serious, I'll squeeze them till they pop?

00:16:21.355 --> 00:16:22.940
Wait, hang on.

00:16:22.940 --> 00:16:24.233
I'm being serious!

00:16:24.233 --> 00:16:26.360
Doing that helps me find the answer.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.486
Really, now?

00:16:27.486 --> 00:16:31.407
Y-Yeah! Don't you know that changing
your character refreshes your brain?

00:16:31.407 --> 00:16:35.411
I am Nico! Okay... Maybe now
I can solve these problems.

00:16:35.411 --> 00:16:38.747
Let's see—substitute this here, and...

00:16:39.248 --> 00:16:40.332
And?

00:16:40.332 --> 00:16:43.252
Uh, then... This is like that, so...

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:46.422
I dunno!

00:16:46.422 --> 00:16:48.382
Time for disciplinary action.

00:16:48.382 --> 00:16:51.719
No, no!

00:16:52.469 --> 00:16:54.388
There's something I'd like to ask you.

00:16:57.308 --> 00:16:58.142
I see.

00:16:59.226 --> 00:17:01.437
Eli-chi said all that to you, did she?

00:17:01.854 --> 00:17:08.277
Yes. Calling A-RISE's dancing and singing
"amateur" was a bit much to accept.

00:17:08.277 --> 00:17:10.571
I'm not surprised Eli-chi went
that far, personally.

00:17:11.572 --> 00:17:14.908
After all, Eli-chi has the skills
to back up her words.

00:17:15.659 --> 00:17:17.119
What do you mean?

00:17:18.162 --> 00:17:19.163
Curious?

00:17:25.085 --> 00:17:26.712
The sun feels so warm...

00:17:26.712 --> 00:17:28.380
Summer is here.

00:17:28.380 --> 00:17:30.966
Okay, let's go until we can't go no more!

00:17:32.551 --> 00:17:34.428
And what do we have here...?

00:17:34.762 --> 00:17:38.932
I seem to recall you three promising
to study inside during lunch.

00:17:39.099 --> 00:17:42.895
W-We know! We totally aren't skipping, but...

00:17:42.895 --> 00:17:46.273
We thought getting some exercise
would make our brains work better!

00:17:46.273 --> 00:17:48.734
They dragged me with them against my will!

00:17:49.318 --> 00:17:52.112
Liar! This whole thing was your idea!

00:17:52.112 --> 00:17:57.159
Yeah, you said something like you can't be a
true idol if you're scared of Nozomi-senpai!

00:17:57.159 --> 00:17:59.119
Don't put words in my mouth!

00:17:59.119 --> 00:18:00.120
I see.

00:18:00.579 --> 00:18:02.665
Well, whose idea it was isn't important.

00:18:02.665 --> 00:18:05.709
You'll all be receiving equal
amounts of disciplinary action.

00:18:09.338 --> 00:18:10.631
This can't be real.

00:18:10.631 --> 00:18:13.842
- No!
- Wow, not bad, Honoka-chin.

00:18:13.842 --> 00:18:16.512
Nozomi-senpai, is this your idea of fun!?

00:18:38.742 --> 00:18:41.203
With that taken care of, let's go back inside.

00:18:43.747 --> 00:18:46.792
Maybe the truth was a bit
too shocking for her...

00:18:49.503 --> 00:18:51.004
Here are today's assignments.

00:18:51.797 --> 00:18:52.881
Demon.

00:18:52.881 --> 00:18:56.093
What was that? Who needs their
bad manners squeezed out?

00:18:56.093 --> 00:18:57.594
Nobody!

00:18:58.595 --> 00:19:01.223
Kotori, please help Honoka study without me.

00:19:01.724 --> 00:19:04.184
What? Okay...

00:19:06.145 --> 00:19:08.564
What's wrong with Umi-senpai?

00:19:08.564 --> 00:19:09.898
I dunno...

00:19:13.819 --> 00:19:15.988
Is this really the best approach?

00:19:15.988 --> 00:19:17.281
Nozomi-senpai...

00:19:17.448 --> 00:19:20.868
Seeing Eli-chi's dancing talents
must have stunned you.

00:19:25.622 --> 00:19:29.877
It did make me wonder what
we've been doing all this time.

00:19:30.669 --> 00:19:36.049
I hate to admit it, but now I see
why she said what she did.

00:19:36.049 --> 00:19:38.051
And you've come to apologize, is that it?

00:19:38.969 --> 00:19:39.970
No.

00:19:40.512 --> 00:19:42.681
I want to ask her to teach us how to dance.

00:19:45.684 --> 00:19:53.358
If we become able to dance half as well as
her, we truly could attract more students.

00:19:55.194 --> 00:19:57.321
Just as I figured.

00:19:58.197 --> 00:20:00.908
I had a feeling you'd say that.

00:20:00.908 --> 00:20:01.992
Nozomi-senpai...

00:20:02.618 --> 00:20:06.330
If that's the case, aren't you forgetting
about a very important task?

00:20:06.747 --> 00:20:08.540
Exam week starts in five days.

00:20:12.586 --> 00:20:13.629
Honoka!

00:20:15.756 --> 00:20:16.924
Oh, Umi-chan...

00:20:17.257 --> 00:20:20.177
Starting today, I will be a
live-in tutor at your house!

00:20:20.344 --> 00:20:21.470
What?

00:20:21.929 --> 00:20:23.514
We will study nonstop!

00:20:23.514 --> 00:20:24.640
Devil woman.

00:20:27.100 --> 00:20:30.687
Yes. I'm doing fine, Grandmother.

00:20:33.524 --> 00:20:36.693
Of course. You graduated from this school.

00:20:37.152 --> 00:20:39.446
I will protect it.

00:20:41.198 --> 00:20:43.534
Yes, good night.

00:21:00.968 --> 00:21:02.177
How did it go?

00:21:02.177 --> 00:21:04.471
You should have received your
test results for all subjects today.

00:21:05.889 --> 00:21:07.307
Honoka-chan!

00:21:07.307 --> 00:21:08.350
Yeah...

00:21:08.350 --> 00:21:09.935
I'm safe.

00:21:10.727 --> 00:21:14.481
You didn't make all our hard
work mean nothing, did you!?

00:21:14.481 --> 00:21:15.774
Spill it!

00:21:18.193 --> 00:21:21.071
I wish I had done just a teensy bit better...

00:21:21.071 --> 00:21:22.281
Ta-da!

00:21:26.118 --> 00:21:29.246
Okay, let's get back to practicing!

00:21:29.246 --> 00:21:30.956
L-Love Live...

00:21:30.956 --> 00:21:33.542
This only gives us permission
to try and enter it, remember?

00:21:33.542 --> 00:21:35.002
I know, but...

00:21:45.095 --> 00:21:45.762
Huh?

00:21:47.180 --> 00:21:49.558
You can't do this! I demand an explanation!

00:21:50.976 --> 00:21:54.479
I'm sorry. The matter has
been settled already.

00:21:55.355 --> 00:21:59.776
Starting next year, Otonokizaka High will
no longer be accepting applications.

00:22:00.110 --> 00:22:01.612
It's closing down.

00:22:11.872 --> 00:22:13.165
Closing down...

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:20.714
sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:21.006 --> 00:22:26.261
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.595 --> 00:22:32.684
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.684 --> 00:22:39.650
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.650 --> 00:22:44.696
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.614 --> 00:22:51.161
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.161 --> 00:22:56.416
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.626 --> 00:23:03.924
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.383 --> 00:23:09.596
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.596 --> 00:23:15.978
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.978 --> 00:23:21.858
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.858 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:36.248 --> 00:23:39.543
Next time on Love Live!
"What I Want to Do"
